[en.DECISION_C04_METEOROLOGICAL_BUREAU]
New Weather Lab

[en.DECISION_C04_METEOROLOGICAL_BUREAU_desc]
Since ancient times, the weather factory and weather laboratory in the cloud city have been responsible for regulating the weather of the entire Equestria continent. With the establishment and downfall of the Meteorological Bureau, these areas have begun to operate independently of various administrative units. Even though different countries, duchies, and dominions are fighting on their own, it is our responsibility as Pegasi to regulate the world’s weather, and we may be able to provide assistance to the Meteorological Bureau.

[zh.DECISION_C04_METEOROLOGICAL_BUREAU]
新天气实验室

[zh.DECISION_C04_METEOROLOGICAL_BUREAU_desc]
自古以来，云中城的天气工厂、天气实验室等地区负责调控着整个小马利亚大陆的天气。随着气象局的设立和没落，这些地区也开始脱离各个行政单位独立运作。即使如今不同的国家、公爵领、自治领各自为战，调控世界天气也是我们天马的责任，我们也许可以为气象局提供援助。
